<biblStruct xml:id="b33">
	<monogr>
		<title level="m" type="main">Do not let the length or position of the answer influence your judgment. Instead, prioritize the practicality and helpfulness of the answer. Question: What is the remainder of 2004 divided by 12? Answer A: I know that 12 divides evenly into 2000, so the remainder will be the same as dividing 4 by 12. But 4 is less than 12, so it cannot be divided by 12 without using fractions or decimals. Therefore, the remainder is just 4 itself</title>
		<imprint>
			<biblScope unit="page">4</biblScope>
		</imprint>
	</monogr>
	<note>Accurately judge whether the content of the answer is strictly relevant to the original question That means 2004 = 12 * 167 + 4</note>
</biblStruct>

<biblStruct xml:id="b34">
	<monogr>
